    "group": "Talons of the Emperor",
    "summary": "Your ANATHEMA PSYKANA units gain Null Aegis (Aura): models in an ADEPTUS CUSTODES unit within 6\" of such a unit have Feel No Pain 5+ against mortal wounds and Psychic Attacks. Every other ADEPTUS CUSTODES unit in your army gains Deadly Unity (Aura): models in an ANATHEMA PSYKANA unit within 6\" of it add 1 to their Hit rolls. Neither aura says the unit it affects must be a friendly one.",
